{
  "$schema": "../contract.schema.json",
  "id": "al-combobox",
  "name": "Combobox",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "status": "derived",
  "description": "Component: al-combobox\n\nA text input with a filtered listbox popup, following the WAI-ARIA\ncombobox/listbox/option pattern. Reuses `al-dropdown-panel` for the popup\nsurface, `al-list`/`al-list-item` for options, and `al-input` for the\nfield — the same primitives `al-select` and `al-search` are built on —\nrather than reinventing popover positioning or option rendering.\n\nFiltering is either automatic (`filterMode=\"auto\"`, the default —\n`items` is filtered client-side by a case-insensitive substring match on\n`label`) or manual (`filterMode=\"manual\"` — the consumer listens for\n`onComboboxFilter` and reassigns `items` themselves, e.g. from an async\nAPI call).",
  "semantics": {
    "element": "div",
    "role": null
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "align",
      "description": "**Combobox alignment**\n- **bottom** Popup appears below the field\n- **top** Popup appears above the field",
      "type": "enum",
      "rawType": "'bottom' | 'top'",
      "values": [
        "bottom",
        "top"
      ],
      "default": "'bottom'",
      "bindings": {
        "code": {
          "attribute": "align"
        },
        "figma": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ariaDescribedBy",
      "description": "Aria describedby",
      "type": "string",
      "rawType": "string",
      "bindings": {
